2026-01-13 06:54:33 | INFO | "./webui\batch_video_generator.py:98": generate_single_video - task.start completed with result: {'videos': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\2ecc64fb-4da8-4e4c-bfa3-7ff3f961151d\\final-1.mp4'], 'combined_videos': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\2ecc64fb-4da8-4e4c-bfa3-7ff3f961151d\\combined-1.mp4'], 'script': 'Korean temple food has become a culinary beacon for vegetarians and vegans worldwide, and it\'s easy to see why. Its popularity stems from a profound respect for nature and a commitment to pure, wholesome ingredients, meticulously prepared without any animal products, garlic, or onions – the traditional "five pungent spices." This deliberate exclusion creates a surprisingly diverse and deeply satisfying flavor profile, showcasing the natural sweetness of vegetables, the earthy depth of mushrooms, and the savory umami of fermented pastes like doenjang and ganjang. Imagine the delicate perfume of steamed lotus leaf wraps, the vibrant crunch of seasoned radish, and the comforting warmth of a simple, yet exquisite, vegetable stew, all crafted with intention and mindfulness. The artistry lies in harnessing the inherent flavors of seasonal ingredients, transforming humble produce into dishes that are both nourishing and incredibly delicious. Think of crispy pan-fried shiitake mushrooms glazed with a sweet soy sauce, or tender pumpkin porridge that feels like a warm embrace on a cool day. The preparation itself is an act of devotion, emphasizing simple techniques that allow the natural essence of each ingredient to shine through. This isn\'t just about abstaining from meat; it\'s about celebrating the bounty of the earth in its purest form, offering a truly mindful and guilt-free dining experience that delights the senses and soothes the soul. Moreover, the philosophy behind Korean temple food extends beyond mere sustenance, offering a spiritual connection to the food we eat. Each dish is a testament to simplicity, balance, and harmony, reflecting the Buddhist principles of compassion and non-violence. The careful selection of ingredients, the mindful cooking process, and the serene dining atmosphere all contribute to a unique and deeply enriching culinary journey. For vegetarians, it\'s an opportunity to explore authentic Korean flavors while adhering to their dietary principles, discovering a world of taste and texture that is both ancient and eternally relevant, proving that deliciousness and ethical eating can be one and the same.', 'terms': ['temple food', 'vegetarian cuisine', 'ingredient preparation'], 'audio_file': 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\2ecc64fb-4da8-4e4c-bfa3-7ff3f961151d\\audio.mp3', 'audio_duration': 129, 'subtitle_path': 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\2ecc64fb-4da8-4e4c-bfa3-7ff3f961151d\\subtitle.srt', 'materials': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-62bea11e70990717c9a6d760119b72a4.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-5bba465f1b22cbec8187cae1a9f5208a.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-832601d878be8cc6c788f5b53fa35b7f.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-fef617d321773e8a90c6d613bcd98e45.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-d190f6d455efed67c3920fac602bc641.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-c435f99c643d68675c90fe370dcc453f.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-d80cee9e89a7028bdf05598b65a83bc1.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-0da5594ebfab61bd59e1fc12387b5c74.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-d9994e7510781748d76b4e7ced91e6e4.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-afabc468aa39f28166576d346075ee95.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-816219f8e78a77585bc93f8d2b8a47c3.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-3eedd938