2026-01-16 22:39:58 | INFO | "./webui\batch_video_generator.py:100": generate_single_video - task.start completed with result: {'videos': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\5169a541-5beb-47ac-908f-c7adf13b164b\\final-1.mp4'], 'combined_videos': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\5169a541-5beb-47ac-908f-c7adf13b164b\\combined-1.mp4'], 'script': "Aerobic exercise is an absolute game-changer for managing diabetes, acting like a powerful natural medicine for your body. When you engage in activities like brisk walking, cycling, or swimming, your muscles become super-efficient at using glucose for energy, meaning more sugar is pulled from your bloodstream. This incredible process directly lowers your blood sugar levels, reducing the strain on your pancreas and improving your insulin sensitivity, making the insulin your body produces work even better. Imagine your body reclaiming its natural ability to regulate sugar; that's the magic of consistent cardio for diabetes. Beyond just blood sugar control, aerobic exercise offers profound benefits for the cardiovascular health that diabetics often struggle with. Regular cardio strengthens your heart muscle, making it pump blood more efficiently and lowering your blood pressure, two critical factors in preventing heart disease and stroke, common complications of diabetes. It also helps improve your cholesterol profile by increasing HDL (good cholesterol) and decreasing LDL (bad cholesterol) and triglycerides, further protecting your vital organs. This isn't just about managing a condition; it's about protecting your future and enhancing your overall well-being. The mental and emotional uplift from aerobic exercise is another crucial, often overlooked, advantage for diabetic patients. Engaging in physical activity releases endorphins, those feel-good chemicals that naturally combat stress, anxiety, and even depression, which can be prevalent when living with a chronic condition. The sense of accomplishment and increased energy levels you gain from regular exercise can significantly boost your self-confidence and motivation to stick with your diabetes management plan. It’s about empowering yourself, reclaiming control, and living a fuller, more vibrant life despite diabetes.", 'terms': ['diabetes management', 'aerobic exercise', 'cardiovascular health', 'weight management'], 'audio_file': 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\5169a541-5beb-47ac-908f-c7adf13b164b\\audio.mp3', 'audio_duration': 117, 'subtitle_path': 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\5169a541-5beb-47ac-908f-c7adf13b164b\\subtitle.srt', 'materials': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-b3f4f9f9be1d7be8d54a150f4b0d42a9.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-28643f8fb340ac905a95ef1454f555cf.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-7c51cffd634377ed33609f221704923c.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-b677df534304cc82767d0779b9ad87d9.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-7280e56b193552c43b97f30a69d98656.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-0ddfbecfc0d72c91cedd2590f03014be.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-8d2cb5bd9255bb256a156a3426333302.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-de1c9f68375fff1c42073d45c59c17d9.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-440142a31e90d8fd58c19c50d276e0f7.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-ec4fe98b24025721d498f577f3cb3075.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-433d7b65dde7cdd6cfd2a350a95794ce.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-aacab3e1ca147477bab0143259827f96.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-aacab3e1ca147477bab0143259827f96.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-433d7b65dde7cdd6cfd2a350a95794ce.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\d